{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Sex Curse</strong>\ud83d\udc8b is a wild mix of comedy, horror, and spicy adult content wrapped into a point-and-click visual novel. It\u2019s packed with ridiculous situations, dark humor, and plenty of nods to iconic horror franchises\u2014all with a playful, seductive twist.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393380/extras/3.2_aion1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743861962\" /><br>The story kicks off when the main character and their friends head to the haunted house for a weekend of fun. Sounds like a perfect getaway, right? Wrong. Things take a turn when they accidentally trigger an ancient ritual, cursing the protagonist with a spell that literally attracts trouble. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393380/extras/23_aion1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743861962\" /><br>From crazy stalkers to ghosts it\u2019s a non-stop rollercoaster of chaos. Luckily, the hero\u2019s got one special \u201ctalent\u201d\u2014everyone, and I mean everyone, is irresistibly drawn to them. Will this charm help them survive the curse or just cause even more drama?<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Comedy-horror with a twist: Expect over-the-top humor, parody vibes, and references to classic horror tropes.<br></li><li>Spicy adult content: Featuring bold scenes, flirty moments, and risqu\u00e9 interactions seamlessly woven into the story.<br></li><li>Quirky characters: From badass monster hunters to seductive ghosts and dangerous villains, everyone\u2019s got their own vibe.<br></li><li>Point-and-click gameplay: Explore eerie locations and avoid deadly traps.<br></li><li>Event Gallery: Relive your favorite scenes anytime in the gallery.<br></li><li>Interactive story: Your choices shape relationships, plot twists, and the game\u2019s ending.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393380/extras/2.3_aion1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743861962\" /><br>Get ready for laughs, chaos, and a little bit of heat. <strong>The Sex Curse</strong>\ud83d\udc8b is here to keep you on your toes (and maybe blush a little)!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enchanted by Sakura","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/8dd2a3f66f1d6d0ed26415212bd57312cf534e4e.jpg"},{"name":"Federica\u2019s Captive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/aa2f4b45c141491aa10eda29b462760750dede23.jpg"},{"name":"Love Tape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/faf4cb8fd7500cec3793bcd0c8e63d7b0bcecfb3.jpg"},{"name":"Flirting with Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/a8e1df6281d1756001118e304a2fb32003569e87.jpg"},{"name":"Seducer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/b1a30cf741e0adfac756ef91e6e53b51aa0b7985.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/bbeb1083fe0f6eeb43482a63098f527ea5dd85c4.jpg"},{"name":"Loverboy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/a806fde6f545848e676b95acb74a9a9c9c106298.jpg"},{"name":"The Curse Remains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/cc382a8cf063495d3418ad86d85ebad0dd358a0d.jpg"},{"name":"Knight of Hearts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/571918a46295246c395a55cf0b8e8a40d6cbb0a6.jpg"},{"name":"Careful Casanova","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3393380/eb54359c954aa50fff5689459455c2cbebe5ec66.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3393380?t=1743861962","bac